data: {"id": "8675758576f9475a-thinking-parallel_evidence-225", "run_id": "8675758576f9475a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将先执行首轮计划，并行发起 Kubernetes (describe) 与 Metrics、Logging、Tracing、Topology 的调用，取得真实结果后再判断。\n\n### 首轮证据采集（Kubernetes + Metrics + Logging + Tracing + Topology）\n\n1.  **Kubernetes Describe**: 获取 pod 状态、事件。\n2.  **Prometheus Metrics**: 获取 Pod 生命周期阶段。\n3.  **Logging**: 获取最近 30 分钟日志。\n4.  **Tracing**: 获取最近 30 分钟流量。\n5.  **Topology**: 获取 Pod 拓扑关系（Owner, Node）。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789372426382, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

